# Committed assets (do NOT ignore): the bundled sample diagrams in template/*.mmap
# and the generated icon rasters (build/*.ico, build/*.png, build/icons/*) are
# checked in so packaging works without the icon/sample dev tools. Regenerate with:
#   node scripts/gen-icons.mjs      (needs sharp + png-to-ico)
#   node scripts/gen-samples.mjs

# Exported diagram images and dev-time web downloads (from `npm run dev`)
*.export.png
/diagram*.png
/diagram*.mmap

